                    {
                        "sense_id": "553dc911-4c0f-3c60-a25a-cfdbc3655eaa",
                        "entry_id": "9939cd67-a511-3bea-bf71-90a94c359c6f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative form of throw-off.",
                            "Income minus expenses and depreciation"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "eb65c8dc-e738-4173-8c92-2e5b7b43185d",
                                "sense_id": "553dc911-4c0f-3c60-a25a-cfdbc3655eaa",
                                "text": "Adding to his depreciation of $750,000, he would have a cash throwoff of $1,100,000."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f22df844-3dfe-4aed-ad60-484b324003fe",
                                "sense_id": "553dc911-4c0f-3c60-a25a-cfdbc3655eaa",
                                "text": "As the equipment is depreciated the cash throwoff generated increases the working capital by an identical amount."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "13a64d17-2694-447c-acc8-8c1586ccb5de",
                                "sense_id": "553dc911-4c0f-3c60-a25a-cfdbc3655eaa",
                                "text": "The cash throwoff becomes available to management to apply to the business in the most desirable manner."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "550a5a87-43a6-482c-9f57-ed7b74bb1a56",
                                "sense_id": "553dc911-4c0f-3c60-a25a-cfdbc3655eaa",
                                "text": "Note that the loan carrying and the second highest interest rate requires the smallest annual payment and yields the lowest cash throwoff."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ff2349ad-52c1-30ce-aa5a-515ca49a8026",
                        "entry_id": "9939cd67-a511-3bea-bf71-90a94c359c6f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative form of throw-off.",
                            "Control for disengaging a mechanism"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea0d489e-2311-43a3-8fcc-3f742e64009b",
                                "sense_id": "ff2349ad-52c1-30ce-aa5a-515ca49a8026",
                                "text": "The impression throwoff lever and starting and stopping buttons are similar to those found on the other presses."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cbffd4cc-ad97-4c28-8c39-1be89366fcdc",
                                "sense_id": "ff2349ad-52c1-30ce-aa5a-515ca49a8026",
                                "text": "When the rhythm and the coordination of hands and foot have been mastered and the printer feels relaxed and at ease, then the throwoff lever is pulled back and printing is started."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "846d3fec-6901-31a5-9aad-9276c2426b92",
                        "entry_id": "9939cd67-a511-3bea-bf71-90a94c359c6f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative form of throw-off.",
                            "Deflection of a projectile"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "69fefcd1-54b7-44ff-9fee-f65a436b3689",
                                "sense_id": "846d3fec-6901-31a5-9aad-9276c2426b92",
                                "text": "We can use the analogy of a vacuum trajectory to examine the lateral throwoff effect generated by either a static or a dynamic imbalance."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b8bd02c8-3fea-3412-9413-0de3248aeff9",
                        "entry_id": "9939cd67-a511-3bea-bf71-90a94c359c6f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative form of throw-off.",
                            "Something off-the-cuff"
                        ],
