                                "sense_id": "2191db0a-708c-393e-8ee3-ee4af0398c19",
                                "text": "Figure 5.40b shows the case of a dam produced by two delayed throwoff blasts in one slope; the upper charge (or row) is fired first and the lower one within a certain interval."
